294
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,240
Wha...

295
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:05,040
Remember, we were on the sleeping porch? We couldn't stop giggling.

296
00:16:05,210 --> 00:16:07,540
Our coconuts kept knocking together.

297
00:16:07,710 --> 00:16:10,210
