300
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:23,940
I'm sorry. I mean, if I thought it happened, I would say it.

301
00:16:24,190 --> 00:16:27,560
Maybe I passed out and you did stuff to me while I was sleeping.

302
00:16:27,730 --> 00:16:30,400
No.

303
00:16:30,570 --> 00:16:33,030
It's okay, you don't have to do this. I believe you.

304
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:37,200
If you say you kissed Melissa, then you kissed Melissa.

305
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:40,410
Thank you, Phoebe.

306
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:40,410
Okay.

307
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:42,290
But she didn't.

308
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:42,290
I know.

309
00:16:46,290 --> 00:16:47,330
Hey.

310
00:16:46,290 --> 00:16:47,330
Hey.

311
