I would, but my pants are a little tight.

319
00:17:05,890 --> 00:17:10,900
A little tight? I could see 00 and 7 in those things.

320
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:15,780
I was looking forward to wearing our celebrity tuxes together.

321
00:17:15,950 --> 00:17:20,070
So you're not gonna be wearing yours?

322
00:17:15,950 --> 00:17:20,070
Are you kidding? It's Batman's tux!

323
