No? Okay.

380
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,200
Wow!

381
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:55,710
I mean, I had no idea that that would...

382
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:03,260
What the hell was that?

383
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:05,970
Just wanted to see what all the fuss was about.

384
00:21:07,010 --> 00:21:09,600
And?

385
00:21:07,010 --> 00:21:09,600
